# Post-Flow Audit — auto after handoff

When you have **finished implementing** a multi-step product feature or critical user flow (code shipped in-session, PR-ready, or user said 완료/끝/머지), **before ending your turn**:

1. Run the `web-service-postflow-audit` skill (Phases 0–8).
2. Output the required scorecard (GO / GO WITH CAVEATS / NO-GO).

**Do not auto-run** when the turn is only Q&A, brainstorming/spec design without implementation, a tiny typo, or the user said to skip the audit / already received a Post-Flow Audit scorecard for this same handoff.
